<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait private deposits rise in February.</title>
<headline>Kuwait private deposits rise in February.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private sector deposits with banks in Kuwait rose to 7.101 billion dinars at the end of February from 7.045 billion at the end of January, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The deposits stood at 7.027 billion in February 1996.</p>
<p>			   Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				  Feb '97    Jan '97    Feb '96</p>
<p>Dinar deposits		5,799.9    5,749.3    5,696.8</p>
<p>Foreign currency deposits 1,301.6    1,295.4    1,329.8</p>
<p>($1 = 0.302 dinar)</p>
</text>
